# Rust build output
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Vendored third-party front-end assets (KaTeX, Mermaid). Fetched at build time
# by scripts/vendor-assets.sh into a gitignored tree; rust-embed still reads
# them from disk. We commit ONLY the vendor script, scripts/assets-manifest.toml
# (pinned versions + sha256), and THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md - never the js/css/
# woff2 bytes themselves.
/crates/mdp-core/assets/vendor/

# Coverage artifacts
*.profraw
lcov.info

# Pending insta snapshots (review, then rename to .snap)
*.snap.new

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Note: Cargo.lock IS committed - mdp ships a binary, so we pin the exact
# dependency graph for reproducible builds. Do not ignore it.
